    'docs/hep.md',
    '2026-10-10',
    'HEP — the Harness Event Protocol: strict JSONL event frames on '
        'stdout for server-side supervisors of headless fa runs.',
  ),
  DocsSource(
    'dap',
    'docs/dap.md',
    '2026-10-10',
    'DAP — the device access protocol hub: local hub lifecycle, '
